    "content": "### Overview: Razorfen Kraul\n\nA thorny quilboar warren in the southern Barrens, run by Charlga Razorflank and her death speakers. It is a compact, mostly linear dungeon and a good first stop once your group reaches the high 20s.\n\n| Parameter | Dungeon Profile |\n|---|---|\n| **Level Range** | 29–38 |\n| **Zone & Entrance** | The Barrens (Southern Razorfen Thornhedge) (`40.8, 87.2`) |\n| **Faction** | Alliance & Horde |\n| **Access** | No key or attunement. |\n| **Boss Encounters** | 6 |\n| **Dungeon Quests** | 6 |\n| **Level 60 BiS Picks** | 1 items across 2 specs |\n\n💡 Boss tactics below follow the Classic encounters. As of November 22, 2026 Blizzard has not published encounter changes for this dungeon; loot, quests and BiS data come from live ForeverDB and Wowhead Forever data.\n\n---\n\n### Getting There\n\n- Horde: fly to Camp Taurajo and ride south-west past the Great Lift road to the thornhedge.\n- Alliance: fly to Thalanaar (Feralas border) or take the long road south from Ratchet; there is no Alliance flight point close by.\n\n🔒 No key or attunement.\n\n---\n\n### Boss Route & Tactics\n\n#### The Warren\n\n1. **Roogug:** Quilboar shaman pack at the entrance tunnels. Interrupt his heals and kill totems as they drop.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Brawler's Leather Helm](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252512) · [Geomancer Headdress](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274155) ✦ · [Roogug's Severed Head](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274152) ✦ · [Thornweaver Drape](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274149) ✦\n2. **Aggem Thorncurse:** Summons a boar companion and heals. Kill the boar or crowd-control it, interrupt heals, then burn Aggem.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Thorncursed Grips](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274159) ✦ · [Thornspike](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6681) · [Death Prophet Spine](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274158) ✦ · [Brawler's Leather Helm](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252512) · [Defender's Leather Helm](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252455) · [Pattern: Brawler's Leather Legguards](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252820) · +3 more\n3. **Death Speaker Jargba:** Casts Dominate Mind on a party member. Keep a fear, polymorph or stun ready for the controlled player and stay spread from the pull so the charmed player cannot chain onto healers.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Death Speaker Scepter](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=2816) · [Death Speaker Mantle](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6685) · [Death Speaker Robes](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6682) · [Brawler's Leather Helm](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252512) · [Wisdom's Leather Helm](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252515)\n4. **Overlord Ramtusk:** Pulls with the nearby guards. Clear the platform first, then tank him away from the ramp so adds do not join.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Corpsemaker](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6687) · [Quillord Mail Leggings](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274161) ✦ · [Tusken Helm](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6686) · [Brawler's Leather Helm](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252512) · [Pattern: Totemic Leather Helm](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252817) ✦ · [Pattern: Trapper's Leather Legguards](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252821) · +3 more\n5. **Agathelos the Raging:** Enrages at low health and hits hard. Save cooldowns and healer mana for the last 30%.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Quilrager Throwing Axe](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274160) ✦ · [Swinetusk Shank](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6691) · [Ferine Leggings](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6690) · [Brawler's Leather Helm](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252512) · [Defender's Leather Helm](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252455) · [Plans: Acolyte's Silvered Chain Leggings](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=251378) · +2 more\n6. **Charlga Razorflank:** Heals herself and her adds. Kill the adds first, interrupt every Chain Heal and bring a poison/disease cleanser for the trash leading up to her.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Agamaggan's Clutch](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6693) · [Heart of Agamaggan](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6694) · [Pronged Reaver](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6692) · [Brawler's Leather Helm](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252512) · [Defender's Leather Helm](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252455) · [Totemic Leather Helm](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252456) · +1 more\n\n📦 **Trash & world drops:** [Batwing Mantle](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6697) · [Nightstalker Bow](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6696) · [Stygian Bone Amulet](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6695) · [Whisperwind Headdress](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6688) · [Wind Spirit Staff](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=6689) · [Avenger's Armor](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=1488) · [Vendetta](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=776) · [Mantle of Thieves](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=2264) · +7 more\n\n✦ marks items that are new in WoW Forever (15 in this dungeon's boss loot).\n\n---\n\n### Level 60 Pre-Raid BiS From This Dungeon\n\n| Item | Boss | Picked By |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Death Speaker Scepter](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=2816) | Death Speaker Jargba | Discipline Priest, Holy Priest |\n\n🎯 Open the BiS tab (Level 60 Pre-Raid) to see these items in each spec's full list.\n\n---\n\n### Dungeon Quests\n\n| Quest | Level | Objective |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Blueleaf Tubers](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=1221) | 26 | Grab a Crate with Holes. Grab a Snufflenose Command Stick. Grab and read the Snufflenose Owner's Manual. In Razorfen Kraul, use the Crate with Holes to summon a Snufflenose Gopher, and use the Command Stick on the gopher to make it search for Tubers. Bring 6 Blueleaf Tubers, the Snufflenose Command Stick and the Crate |\n| [Mortality Wanes](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=1142) | 30 | Find and return Treshala's Pendant to Treshala Fallowbrook in Darnassus. |\n| [Willix the Importer](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=1144) | 30 | Escort Willix the Importer out of Razorfen Kraul. |\n| [Going, Going, Guano!](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=1109) | 33 | Bring 1 pile of Kraul Guano to Master Apothecary Faranell in the Undercity. |\n| [A Vengeful Fate](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=1102) | 34 | Bring Razorflank's Heart to Auld Stonespire in Thunder Bluff. |\n| [The Crone of the Kraul](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=1101) | 34 | Bring Razorflank's Medallion to Falfindel Waywarder in Thalanaar. |\n\n---\n\n### Tips\n\n- Quilboar packs include healers and Frenzy casters: mark kill order on every pull.\n- Several RFK quests start in the Barrens and Thousand Needles; check the quest table below before you go in.\n\n📦 Data: ForeverDB live instance data (build 1.60.1.71037), WoW: Forever item database, Level 60 BiS lists and Wowhead Forever quest data, compiled November 22, 2026."
