    "content": "### Overview: Razorfen Downs\n\nThe quilboar burial grounds, taken over by the Scourge and Amnennar the Coldbringer. Expect lots of undead, diseases and one gong event.\n\n| Parameter | Dungeon Profile |\n|---|---|\n| **Level Range** | 37–46 |\n| **Zone & Entrance** | The Barrens (south-east, above Thousand Needles) (`49.0, 93.9`) |\n| **Faction** | Alliance & Horde |\n| **Access** | No key. Blizzard lists it as 25+; the ForeverDB/client range is used here. |\n| **Boss Encounters** | 6 |\n| **Dungeon Quests** | 9 |\n\n💡 Boss tactics below follow the Classic encounters. As of November 22, 2026 Blizzard has not published encounter changes for this dungeon; loot, quests and BiS data come from live ForeverDB and Wowhead Forever data.\n\n---\n\n### Getting There\n\n- Horde: fly to Camp Taurajo and ride south to the Great Lift, then follow the thorns east.\n- Alliance: fly to Thalanaar or Freewind Post area routes; most groups summon at the entrance.\n\n🔒 No key. Blizzard lists it as 25+; the ForeverDB/client range is used here.\n\n---\n\n### Boss Route & Tactics\n\n#### The Downs\n\n1. **Tuten'kash:** Summoned by ringing the gong in the central room: three waves of spiders, then the boss. Bring AoE for the waves and a poison cleanse.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Arachnid Gloves](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10777) · [Carapace of Tuten'kash](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10775) · [Silky Spider Cape](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10776)\n2. **Plaguemaw the Rotting:** Rare boss. Disease-heavy melee: cleanse and keep him tanked away from casters.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Plaguerot Sprig](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10766) · [Swine Fists](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10760)\n3. **Mordresh Fire Eye:** Fire caster with shields. Interrupt Fireball and kill the escort skeletons first.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Deathmage Sash](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10771) · [Glowing Eye of Mordresh](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10769) · [Mordresh's Lifeless Skull](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10770)\n4. **Ragglesnout:** Rare quilboar caster who uses Dominate Mind and heals. Interrupt and break the charm quickly.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Pattern: Skirmisher's Mail Boots](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=252898) · [Boar Champion's Belt](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10768) · [Savage Boar's Guard](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10767) · [X'caliboar](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10758)\n5. **Glutton:** Big abomination with an AoE disease cloud. Melee rotate out; he enrages at low health.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Abomination Chain](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274385) ✦ · [Fleshhide Shoulders](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10774) · [Glutton's Cleaver](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10772)\n6. **Amnennar the Coldbringer:** Frost Nova and Frostbolt Volley; at two health thresholds he summons Frozen Spectres. AoE the spectres, keep the tank topped through the volleys and use frost resistance if you have it.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Bonefingers](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10765) · [Coldbringer Spine](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274381) ✦ · [Coldrage Dagger](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10761) · [Deathchill Armor](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10764) · [Icemetal Barbute](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10763) · [Robes of the Lich](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10762)\n\n📦 **Trash & world drops:** [Thoughtcast Boots](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10578) · [Boneslasher](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10573) · [Ebony Boneclub](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10571) · [Briar Tredders](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10582) · [Stormgale Fists](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10584) · [Sealed Expert's Writ](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=262889) ✦\n\n✦ marks items that are new in WoW Forever (2 in this dungeon's boss loot).\n\n---\n\n### Dungeon Quests\n\n| Quest | Level | Objective |\n|---|---|---|\n| [A Host of Evil](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=6626) | 35 | Kill 8 Razorfen Battleguard, 8 Razorfen Thornweavers, and 8 Death's Head Cultists and return to Myriam Moonsinger near the entrance to Razorfen Downs. |\n| [An Unholy Alliance](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=6521) | 36 | Bring Ambassador Malcin's Head to Varimathras in the Undercity. |\n| [An Unholy Alliance](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=6522) | 36 | Take the Small Scroll to Varimathras in the Undercity. |\n| [Extinguishing the Idol](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=3525) | 37 | Escort Belnistrasz to the Quilboar's idol in Razorfen Downs. Protect Belnistrasz while he performs the ritual to shut down the idol. |\n| [Scourge of the Downs](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=3523) | 37 | If you agree to aid Belnistrasz, speak with him again and hand the Oathstone he gave you back to him. |\n| [The Coldbringer's Eye](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=96773) | 41 | Recover The Coldbringer's Eye from Razorfen Downs. |\n| [The Coldbringer's Eye](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=97196) | 41 | Recover The Coldbringer's Eye from Razorfen Downs. |\n| [Bring the End](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=3341) | 42 | Andrew Brownell wants you to kill Amnennar the Coldbringer and return his skull. |\n| [Bring the Light](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=3636) | 42 | Archbishop Bendictus wants you to slay Amnennar the Coldbringer in Razorfen Downs. |\n\n---\n\n### Tips\n\n- Disease and poison are constant here: Paladins, Priests, Shamans and Druids make the run much easier.\n- Many quests start in the Barrens and Thousand Needles; check the quest table below before you go in.\n\n📦 Data: ForeverDB live instance data (build 1.60.1.71037), WoW: Forever item database, Level 60 BiS lists and Wowhead Forever quest data, compiled November 22, 2026."
