    "content": "### Overview: Zul'Farrak\n\nA sand-troll city in the Tanaris desert. The highlight is the pyramid event, where the group frees prisoners and holds the stairs against waves of trolls.\n\n| Parameter | Dungeon Profile |\n|---|---|\n| **Level Range** | 44–54 |\n| **Zone & Entrance** | Tanaris (north-west desert ruins) (`39.2, 19.8`) |\n| **Faction** | Alliance & Horde |\n| **Access** | No key. The Mallet of Zul'Farrak (from the Hinterlands, Altar of Zul) is needed to summon Gahz'rilla. |\n| **Boss Encounters** | 8 |\n| **Dungeon Quests** | 11 |\n\n💡 Boss tactics below follow the Classic encounters. As of November 22, 2026 Blizzard has not published encounter changes for this dungeon; loot, quests and BiS data come from live ForeverDB and Wowhead Forever data.\n\n---\n\n### Getting There\n\n- Both factions: fly to Gadgetzan and ride west/north-west to the gates. Hearth to Gadgetzan for repeat runs.\n\n🔒 No key. The Mallet of Zul'Farrak (from the Hinterlands, Altar of Zul) is needed to summon Gahz'rilla.\n\n---\n\n### Boss Route & Tactics\n\n#### Outer City\n\n1. **Antu'sul:** Summons basilisk waves and heals himself. Kill the healing ward and adds, then burn him.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Lifeblood Amulet](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9641) · [The Hand of Antu'sul](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9639) · [Vice Grips](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9640)\n2. **Theka the Martyr:** At low health he turns into a scarab and becomes immune to physical damage: casters finish him. Nearby scarabs swarm, so keep AoE ready.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Sandfury Pauldrons](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274638) ✦\n3. **Witch Doctor Zum'rah:** Raises zombies from the graveyard. Pull him away from the graves and kill his ward.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Jumanza Grips](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18083) · [Zum'rah's Vexing Cane](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=18082)\n4. **Hydromancer Velratha:** Water caster near the Sacred Pool. Interrupt Healing Wave; she drops a Tablet of Theka quest item.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Wall of Water](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274652) ✦ · [Zealot Plate](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274651) ✦\n\n#### The Pyramid\n\n1. **Nekrum Gutchewer:** Fought with Sezz'ziz after the pyramid stair waves. Kill Sezz'ziz first (healer and psychic scream), then Nekrum.\n2. **Shadowpriest Sezz'ziz:** Heals Nekrum and casts Psychic Scream. Interrupt and focus him first.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Bad Mojo Mask](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9470) · [Diabolic Skiver](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9475) · [Jinxed Hoodoo Kilt](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9474) · [Jinxed Hoodoo Skin](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9473)\n3. **Chief Ukorz Sandscalp:** Fought with Ruuzlu. Tank them apart; Ukorz cleaves and enrages. Kill Ruuzlu first if your tank is struggling.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Big Bad Pauldrons](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9476) · [Jang'thraze the Protector](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=11086) · [The Chief's Enforcer](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9477)\n\n#### Sacred Pool (optional)\n\n1. **Gahz'rilla:** Summoned by using the Mallet of Zul'Farrak at the pool gong. Ice Blast and Slam knock players back; avoid standing near the cliff edge.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Gahz'rilla Fang](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9467) · [Gahz'rilla Scale Armor](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=9469)\n\n📦 **Trash & world drops:** [Peacekeeper Wand](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274655) ✦ · [Farraki Kris](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274647) ✦ · [Sandfury Guillotine](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274654) ✦ · [Sandstalker Ankleguards](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=12470) · [The Desert Rose](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=274648) ✦\n\n✦ marks items that are new in WoW Forever (4 in this dungeon's boss loot).\n\n---\n\n### Dungeon Quests\n\n| Quest | Level | Objective |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Scarab Shells](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=2865) | 45 | Bring 5 Uncracked Scarab Shells to Tran'rek in Gadgetzan. |\n| [The Spider God](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=2936) | 45 | Read from the Tablet of Theka to learn the name of the Witherbark spider god, then return to Master Gadrin. |\n| [Tran'rek](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=2864) | 45 | Speak with Tran'rek in Gadgetzan. |\n| [Troll Temper](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=3042) | 45 | Bring 20 Vials of Troll Temper to Trenton Lighthammer in Gadgetzan. |\n| [Tabetha's Task](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=2861) | 46 | Speak with Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh. |\n| [The Witch Doctor's Head](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=96770) | 46 | Slay Witch Doctor Zum'rah and bring Zum'rah's Head to Archmage Lan'dalock in Dalaran. |\n| [Tiara of the Deep](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=2846) | 46 | Bring the Tiara of the Deep to Tabetha in Dustwallow Marsh. |\n| [Divino-matic Rod](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=2768) | 47 | Bring the Divino-matic Rod to Chief Engineer Bilgewhizzle in Gadgetzan. |\n| [Nekrum's Medallion](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=2991) | 47 | Bring Nekrum's Medallion to Thadius Grimshade in the Blasted Lands. |\n| [The Prophecy of Mosh'aru](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=3527) | 47 | Bring the First and Second Mosh'aru Tablets to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris. |\n| [Gahz'rilla](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=2770) | 50 | Bring Gahz'rilla's Electrified Scale to Wizzle Brassbolts in the Shimmering Flats. |\n\n---\n\n### Tips\n\n- Pyramid event: free Sergeant Bly's group, then hold the top of the stairs. Waves come from all sides; AoE and a strong healer keep it safe.\n- Bly's group turns hostile after the event. Kill them for the Divino-matic Rod key item.\n\n📦 Data: ForeverDB live instance data (build 1.60.1.71037), WoW: Forever item database, Level 60 BiS lists and Wowhead Forever quest data, compiled November 22, 2026."
