    "content": "### Overview: Maraudon\n\nA huge cavern of corrupted centaur, satyrs and the earth princess Theradras. Two outer wings meet at Zaetar's Grave and the inner sanctum.\n\n| Parameter | Dungeon Profile |\n|---|---|\n| **Level Range** | 46–55 |\n| **Zone & Entrance** | Desolace (Maraudon, west of the Valley of Spears) (`29.0, 62.5`) |\n| **Faction** | Alliance & Horde |\n| **Access** | No key. The Scepter of Celebras (quest) opens the shortcut from the outer area to the inner sanctum for faster repeat runs. |\n| **Boss Encounters** | 8 |\n| **Dungeon Quests** | 13 |\n| **Level 60 BiS Picks** | 2 items across 3 specs |\n\n💡 Boss tactics below follow the Classic encounters. As of November 22, 2026 Blizzard has not published encounter changes for this dungeon; loot, quests and BiS data come from live ForeverDB and Wowhead Forever data.\n\n---\n\n### Getting There\n\n- Horde: fly to Shadowprey Village and ride north-east.\n- Alliance: fly to Nijel's Point and ride south through the Valley of Spears.\n\n🔒 No key. The Scepter of Celebras (quest) opens the shortcut from the outer area to the inner sanctum for faster repeat runs.\n\n---\n\n### Forever Changes & Hotfixes\n\n- **Nov 9, 2026 (Blizzard hotfix):** Fixed a progression blocker where Zaetar's Spirit did not spawn after Princess Theradras was defeated.\n\n---\n\n### Boss Route & Tactics\n\n#### Purple (Satyr) Wing\n\n1. **Noxxion:** Splits into poison slimes at intervals. AoE the slimes and cleanse the poison.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Heart of Noxxion](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17744) · [Noxious Shooter](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17745) · [Noxxion's Shackles](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17746)\n2. **Razorlash:** Cleaves and hits hard; tank faces him away and the group stays behind.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Brusslehide Leggings](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17751) · [Chloromesh Girdle](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17750) · [Vinerot Sandals](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17748)\n\n#### Orange (Centaur) Wing\n\n1. **Lord Vyletongue:** Satyr who blinks and multi-shots. Kill his guards, keep him in melee range with stuns.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Infernal Trickster Leggings](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17754) · [Satyr's Lash](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17752) · [Satyrmane Sash](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17755)\n\n#### Inner Maraudon\n\n1. **Tinkerer Gizlock:** Goblin with bombs and a gun. Easy if you interrupt and stay out of the bomb area.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Gizlock's Hypertech Buckler](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17718) · [Inventor's Focal Sword](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17719)\n2. **Celebras the Cursed:** Roots and summons corrupted forces. Free roots with Freedom/Escape Artist; after the kill, speak with his spirit for the Scepter chain.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Claw of Celebras](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17738) · [Grovekeeper's Drape](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17739) · [Soothsayer's Headdress](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17740)\n3. **Landslide:** Knockbacks and summoned rock adds. Tank against a wall, AoE adds.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Cloud Stone](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17737) · [Fist of Stone](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17943) · [Helm of the Mountain](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17734) · [Rockgrip Gauntlets](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17736)\n4. **Rotgrip:** Big crocolisk in the water room. Simple, but watch out for the patrols around the lake.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Albino Crocscale Boots](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17728) · [Gatorbite Axe](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17730) · [Rotgrip Mantle](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17732)\n5. **Princess Theradras:** Repulsive Gaze knocks players back, and Dust Field pulses. Tank her near a wall so knockbacks do not scatter the group, and keep healers out of melee. Defeat her to free Zaetar's Spirit.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Blackstone Ring](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17713) · [Bracers of the Stone Princess](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17714) · [Charstone Dirk](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17710) · [Elemental Rockridge Leggings](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17711) · [Eye of Theradras](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17715) · [Gemshard Heart](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17707) · +1 more\n\n📦 **Trash & world drops:** [Fungus Shroud Armor](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17742)\n\n---\n\n### Level 60 Pre-Raid BiS From This Dungeon\n\n| Item | Boss | Picked By |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Blade of Eternal Darkness](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17780) | Princess Theradras | Arcane Mage, Balance Druid |\n| [Resurgence Rod](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=17743) | Various | Restoration Shaman |\n\n🎯 Open the BiS tab (Level 60 Pre-Raid) to see these items in each spec's full list.\n\n---\n\n### Dungeon Quests\n\n| Quest | Level | Objective |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Shadowshard Fragments](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7068) | 42 | Collect 10 Shadowshard Fragments from Maraudon and return them to Uthel'nay in Orgrimmar. |\n| [Shadowshard Fragments](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7070) | 42 | Collect 10 Shadowshard Fragments from Maraudon and return them to Archmage Tervosh in Theramore on the coast of Dustwallow Marsh. |\n| [Twisted Evils](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7028) | 47 | Collect 25 Theradric Crystal Carvings for Willow in Desolace. |\n| [Vyletongue Corruption](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7029) | 47 | Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon. Use the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge. Heal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Vark Battlescar in Shadowprey Village. |\n| [Vyletongue Corruption](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7041) | 47 | Fill the Coated Cerulean Vial at the orange crystal pool in Maraudon. Use the Filled Cerulean Vial on the Vylestem Vines to force the corrupted Noxxious Scion to emerge. Heal 8 plants by killing these Noxxious Scion, then return to Talendria in Nijel's Point. |\n| [The Pariah's Instructions](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7067) | 48 | Read the Pariah's Instructions. Afterwards, obtain the Amulet of Union from Maraudon and return it to the Centaur Pariah in southern Desolace. |\n| [Legends of Maraudon](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7044) | 49 | Recover the two parts of the Scepter of Celebras: the Celebrian Rod and the Celebrian Diamond. Find a way to speak with Celebras. |\n| [Rot and Regret](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=93404) | 49 | Venture to Maraudon and recover a Vial of Earth Song Water and return it to Woodwyrd at the Forlorn Gardens in Desolace. |\n| [The Scepter of Celebras](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7046) | 49 | Assist Celebras the Redeemed while he creates the Scepter of Celebras. Speak with him when the ritual is complete. |\n| [Corruption of Earth and Seed](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7064) | 51 | Slay Princess Theradras and return to Selendra near Shadowprey Village in Desolace. |\n| [Corruption of Earth and Seed](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7065) | 51 | Slay Princess Theradras and return to Keeper Marandis at Nijel's Point in Desolace. |\n| [Seed of Life](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=7066) | 51 | Seek out Remulos in Moonglade and give him the Seed of Life. |\n| [Rite of Vision](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=771) | – | Collect 2 Well Stones and 2 Ambercorn and bring them back to Zarlman Two-Moons in Bloodhoof Village. |\n\n---\n\n### Tips\n\n- Princess runs are a classic gold and gear farm: groups often skip both wings and go straight in via the waterfall.\n\n📦 Data: ForeverDB live instance data (build 1.60.1.71037), WoW: Forever item database, Level 60 BiS lists and Wowhead Forever quest data, compiled November 22, 2026."
