    "content": "### Overview: Sunken Temple (Temple of Atal'Hakkar)\n\nThe drowned temple of the Atal'ai trolls, guarded by a green dragonflight. It is a multi-level puzzle dungeon with the Avatar of Hakkar event and Shade of Eranikus at the bottom.\n\n| Parameter | Dungeon Profile |\n|---|---|\n| **Level Range** | 50–60 |\n| **Zone & Entrance** | Swamp of Sorrows (sunken temple lake) (`69.5, 53.5`) |\n| **Faction** | Alliance & Horde |\n| **Access** | No key. For the Avatar of Hakkar, someone needs the Egg of Hakkar (from the Atal'ai quest chain in Tanaris). |\n| **Boss Encounters** | 8 |\n| **Dungeon Quests** | 9 |\n| **Level 60 BiS Picks** | 2 items across 2 specs |\n\n💡 Boss tactics below follow the Classic encounters. As of November 22, 2026 Blizzard has not published encounter changes for this dungeon; loot, quests and BiS data come from live ForeverDB and Wowhead Forever data.\n\n---\n\n### Getting There\n\n- Horde: fly to Stonard and ride east to the lake; dive into the temple ruins.\n- Alliance: fly to Nethergarde Keep and ride north-west into the swamp.\n\n🔒 No key. For the Avatar of Hakkar, someone needs the Egg of Hakkar (from the Atal'ai quest chain in Tanaris).\n\n---\n\n### Boss Route & Tactics\n\n#### Upper Ring & Statue Room\n\n1. **Atal'alarion:** Activate the statues in the correct order in the bottom room to summon him. He knocks players back and hits hard; ranged spread around the room.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Darkwater Bracers](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10800)\n\n#### Dragonkin Balconies\n\n1. **Dreamscythe:** Green dragon with Acid Breath and Wing Buffet. Tank faces him away; nobody stands in front.\n2. **Weaver:** Paired with Dreamscythe on the balconies. Same rules: face away, avoid the front.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Drakeclaw Band](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10795)\n3. **Hazzas:** Spawns with Morphaz after the balcony dragons. Breath and Wing Buffet; kill one at a time.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Drakeclaw Band](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10795)\n4. **Morphaz:** Fights with Hazzas. Drops the Essence of Eranikus quest item.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Bloodfire Talons](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=12464) · [Nightfall Drape](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=12465)\n\n#### Inner Sanctum\n\n1. **Jammal'an the Prophet:** Hexes players and heals. His partner Ogom curses; dispel hexes and kill Jammal'an fast.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Gloves of the Atal'ai Prophet](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10808) · [Vestments of the Atal'ai Prophet](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10806)\n2. **Avatar of Hakkar:** Use the Egg of Hakkar to start. Kill Hakkari Bloodkeepers to extinguish the braziers with the Hakkari Blood they drop. When the Avatar spawns, tank him away from the group; his curse lowers stats and he silences.\n3. **Shade of Eranikus:** Final dragon. Sleeps players and breathes. Spread out, keep him tanked facing away and use Nature resistance if you have it.\n   - 📦 Notable drops: [Crest of Supremacy](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10835) · [Horns of Eranikus](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10833) · [Tooth of Eranikus](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10837)\n\n📦 **Trash & world drops:** [Blade of the Wretched](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10803) · [Eater of the Dead](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10805) · [Fist of the Damned](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=10804) · [Pattern: Green Dragonscale Leggings](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=15733)\n\n---\n\n### Level 60 Pre-Raid BiS From This Dungeon\n\n| Item | Boss | Picked By |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Embrace of the Wind Serpent](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=12462) | Various | Restoration Druid |\n| [Fire Ruby](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=20036) | Various | Fire Mage |\n\n🎯 Open the BiS tab (Level 60 Pre-Raid) to see these items in each spec's full list.\n\n---\n\n### Dungeon Quests\n\n| Quest | Level | Objective |\n|---|---|---|\n| [Into The Temple of Atal'Hakkar](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=1475) | 50 | Gather 10 Atal'ai Tablets for Brohann Caskbelly in Stormwind. |\n| [The Temple of Atal'Hakkar](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=1445) | 50 | Collect 20 Fetishes of Hakkar and bring them to Fel'Zerul in Stonard. |\n| [Into the Depths](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=3446) | 51 | Find the Altar of Hakkar in the Sunken Temple in Swamp of Sorrows. |\n| [Secret of the Circle](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=3447) | 51 | Travel into the Sunken Temple and discover the secret hidden in the circle of statues. |\n| [The Sunken Temple](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=3380) | 51 | Find Marvon Rivetseeker in Tanaris. |\n| [Zapper Fuel](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=4146) | 52 | Deliver the Unloaded Zapper and 5 samples of Atal'ai Haze to Larion in Marshal's Refuge. |\n| [Jammal'an the Prophet](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=1446) | 53 | The Atal'ai Exile in The Hinterlands wants the Head of Jammal'an. |\n| [The God Hakkar](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=3528) | 53 | Bring the Filled Egg of Hakkar to Yeh'kinya in Tanaris. |\n| [The Essence of Eranikus](https://www.wowhead.com/forever/quest=3373) | 55 | Place the Essence of Eranikus in the Essence Font located in this lair in the Sunken Temple. |\n\n---\n\n### Tips\n\n- Level 50 class quests end here, and Forever gives all three rewards: see [Sunken Temple class quests](#guides/guide-sunken-temple-class-quests) before you enter.\n- The temple is three stacked rings. Learn the balcony route before pulling: falling into the central pit means a long walk back.\n\n📦 Data: ForeverDB live instance data (build 1.60.1.71037), WoW: Forever item database, Level 60 BiS lists and Wowhead Forever quest data, compiled November 22, 2026."
